# Search-only overrides (ripgrep / Claude Code's Grep read this; git does not; ruff does too).
# .gitignore keeps email data out of git; this keeps the markdown parts visible to search.
# Only .md under raw/ comes back: .msg originals and raw attachments (which could be .py) stay hidden.
!/wiki/
!/wiki/**
!/raw/
/raw/**
!/raw/**/
!/raw/**/*.md
